{"id":"7a804bf41cb20efd","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-positive-inductive-definition.md","title":"正归纳定义及 ID1 比较理论","display":"df-positive-inductive-definition — 正归纳定义及 ID1 比较理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-positive-inductive-definition","aliases":["91-df-positive-inductive-definition"],"display":"df-positive-inductive-definition — 正归纳定义及 ID1 比较理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-positive-inductive-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-positive-inductive-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-positive-inductive-definition — 正归纳定义及 ID1 比较理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为基础算术；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a> 的全语言归纳模式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(P,x)\">\\(\\theta(P,x)\\)</span> 是基础算术语言加一元谓词参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的公式，仅 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 自由；展开蕴涵后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 只在偶数个否定下出现。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(A,n)\">\\(\\theta(A,n)\\)</span> 表示标准算术结构中把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 解释成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_\\theta\">\\(F_\\theta\\)</span> 是所定义的算子。</li>\n<li>每个这样的标准公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 对应一个新谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_\\theta\">\\(I_\\theta\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}\\)</span> 是加入全部这些符号后的可递归语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(x,\\vec y)\">\\(\\psi(x,\\vec y)\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}\\)</span> 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(\\psi,x)\">\\(\\theta(\\psi,x)\\)</span> 表示避免捕获地以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_\\theta,\\mathrm{Min}_\\theta,\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_\\theta,\\mathrm{Min}_\\theta,\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 为下述模式及理论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\\quad\nF_\\theta(A)\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:(\\mathbb N,P\\mapsto A)\\models\\theta(P,n)\\},\n\\qquad I_\\theta^{\\mathbb N}=\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:F_\\theta(A)\\subseteq A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\\quad\nF_\\theta(A)\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:(\\mathbb N,P\\mapsto A)\\models\\theta(P,n)\\},\n\\qquad I_\\theta^{\\mathbb N}=\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:F_\\theta(A)\\subseteq A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_\\theta\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,(\\theta(I_\\theta,x)\\to I_\\theta(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cl}_\\theta\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,(\\theta(I_\\theta,x)\\to I_\\theta(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Min}_\\theta\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\forall\\vec y\\,[\\forall x(\\theta(\\psi,x)\\to\\psi(x,\\vec y))\\to\n\\forall x(I_\\theta(x)\\to\\psi(x,\\vec y))]:\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Min}_\\theta\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\forall\\vec y\\,[\\forall x(\\theta(\\psi,x)\\to\\psi(x,\\vec y))\\to\n\\forall x(I_\\theta(x)\\to\\psi(x,\\vec y))]:\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{\\theta}(\\{\\mathrm{Cl}_\\theta\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Min}_\\theta)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ID}_1\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{\\theta}(\\{\\mathrm{Cl}_\\theta\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Min}_\\theta)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正出现确保 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_\\theta\">\\(F_\\theta\\)</span> 单调；环境幂集上的交给出最小固定点。对象理论的最小性是对可定义类的模式，而不是对象算术直接量化所有子集。\n原书 第 17 章末 区分只有固定点存在的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{ID}}_1\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{ID}}_1\\)</span> 与增加最小性模式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span>，并把 KF 与前者、KF 加最小性及 VF 与后者比较。下式展开标准 ID<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_1\">\\(_1\\)</span> 比较系统，避免把“存在一个固定点”误当成“存在最小固定点”。\n新增的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_\\theta\">\\(I_\\theta\\)</span> 不出现在定义其算子的基础公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 中，所以这里没有二次迭代归纳定义；全归纳及最小性测试公式可使用这些新谓词。</p>\n<p>来源：第 17 章末，印刷页 248，PDF 页 259；第 18 章，印刷页 251；标准比较理论的上述模式展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}$ 为基础算术；$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}$ 为 [[91-df-induction-schema]] 的全语言归纳模式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(P,x)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(A,n)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"I_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(x,\\vec y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(\\psi,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_\\theta,\\mathrm{Min}_\\theta,\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\\quad\nF_\\theta(A)\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:(\\mathbb N,P\\mapsto A)\\models\\theta(P,n)\\},\n\\qquad I_\\theta^{\\mathbb N}=\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:F_\\theta(A)\\subseteq A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_\\theta\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,(\\theta(I_\\theta,x)\\to I_\\theta(x)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Min}_\\theta\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\forall\\vec y\\,[\\forall x(\\theta(\\psi,x)\\to\\psi(x,\\vec y))\\to\n\\forall x(I_\\theta(x)\\to\\psi(x,\\vec y))]:\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{\\theta}(\\{\\mathrm{Cl}_\\theta\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Min}_\\theta)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"F_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\mathrm{ID}}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"_1","display":false},{"tex":"I_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":2785,"backlinks":[{"id":"acbd9c4756abbc20","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}$；PA 一致，$\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}$ 为算术后果等价，$\\mathrm{ID}_1$ 见 [[91-df-positive-inductive-definition]]。"},{"id":"d84df7f701355c56","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-positive-inductive-definition]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-positive-inductive-definition]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-d